Subject: drm/msm: own and verify the Pico standalone panel mux

Bind the optional native-panel route to the panel lifecycle. Acquire all
bridge control GPIOs without toggling them, reject active or unknown bridge
state, and recheck the native route before panel power-on.

---
diff --git a/techpack/display/msm/Makefile b/techpack/display/msm/Makefile
--- a/techpack/display/msm/Makefile
+++ b/techpack/display/msm/Makefile
@@ -98,6 +98,7 @@
 	dsi/dsi_drm.o \
 	dsi/dsi_display.o \
 	dsi/dsi_panel.o \
+	dsi/pico_panel_mux.o \
 	dsi/dsi_clk_manager.o \
 	dsi/dsi_display_test.o \
 
